opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "Webhook application to send pixel daily themes to Discord"
description:
  "A small OCaml appliaction to retrieve the latest pixel dailies posts from Bluesky (pixeldailies.bsky.social) and send them to the Pixel Paradise Discord server via webhook. This replaces a heavier Gleam-based full bot, which was computationally much heavier and found to be not necessary."
